    "cultureEyebrow": "SISKON CULTURE",
    "cultureTitle": "Mind and Technology Shaping the Industrial Future",
    "cultureDesc1": "Siskon is an independent engineering firm operating in industrial software, automation, and data analytics, developing its own technology with innovative solutions. From process automation to IIoT, high-level traceability solutions to AI-based data systems, we make production processes more efficient, traceable, and smart.",
    "cultureDesc2": "Since 1997, we have been leading digital transformation in automotive, white goods, food, textile, tobacco, and machinery sectors. With our own algorithms, in-house developed hardware, and non-stop R&D energy, we place software at the center of industrial intelligence.",
