    "highlight1Title": "Solutions Beyond Boundaries",
    "highlight1Text": "With our own algorithms, in-house hardware, and global-scale projects, we position software at the center of industrial intelligence. Today, Siskon-powered solutions run in dozens of countries, across many industries, and in hundreds of systems worldwide.",
    "highlight2Title": "From Founders Vision to Young Minds",
    "highlight2Text": "Siskon is more than a conventional engineering company. We combine the discipline of experience with the agility and openness of younger generations. We listen to every idea, evaluate every data point, and share every success.",
    "highlight3Title": "Team Spirit, Innovation Culture",
    "highlight3Text": "Building technology alone is never easy. That is why Siskon is a collective engineering team rather than just an institution. Experts from software architecture, data science, hardware, and young engineering talent work with one shared vision.",
    "highlight4Title": "Beyond Solution Partnership, We Create Value",
    "highlight4Text": "We treat our partners goals as our own and build value partnerships that go beyond solution delivery. For sustainable success, we stand by your side in every project with shared vision, trust, and engineering excellence."
